# Every folder under data/sites/ is local-only and ignored EXCEPT
# example-site, which stays tracked as the one committed sample fixture.
# Any other site folder that lands here (bootstrap runs, pilot cameras,
# local testing, etc.) is never committed.
data/sites/*
!data/sites/README.md
